{
  "_about": "How Scryfall Tagger tags (searched as otag:<tag>) become the roles Eregion shows. A card gets the FIRST category, from the top, that it has any tag of, so the order is the priority: a card that is both a board wipe and removal is a Board Wipe. Tutor sits below Removal and Ramp on purpose, because Tagger also calls a land search (Cultivate) or Path to Exile a tutor. Cards with none of these tags stay uncategorized. Tags are Tagger slugs; a tag that does not exist on Scryfall just finds nothing. longTail lists roles that only apply to cards none of the main categories claimed: each is named after what Scryfall's community calls it, ranked below the main roles, and the order is its priority.",
